FAQ = [
 ('I saved an entry by mistake. How do I undo it?', '↶ History (Ctrl+Shift+Z) lists your last 20 entries — undo any of them. Older entries: open the entry from the Day Book and delete or edit it.'),
 ('The bank statement has a payee that is not in my heads.', 'In the 🗂 Sort heads step choose ➕ New head — it is created for you when you continue. Keep 📌 ticked and it is remembered next time.'),
 ('A member says the balance is wrong.', 'Open Member Ledger → ❓ Why this balance. It shows how the balance is made up: opening balance, bills, supplementary bills, interest, receipts and adjustments. Send the 🔗 Share link so the member sees the same ledger.'),
 ('Bills show the wrong charge for one flat.', 'Billing Setup → change the amount for that flat → open the bill and edit it (or re-run the bills for that period).'),
 ('Can I work without internet?', 'Yes, for a short time. Entries are kept on the device and sent when the connection comes back. Do not clear the browser data while offline.'),
 ('The screen looks old after an update.', 'Press Ctrl+F5 on a PC, or close and open the app again on a phone.'),
]
